    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30858" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">neurŏbăta</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-es</span></b> , ae,
